  "title": "Add an Equip Command to Shops [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "ショップに装備コマンドを追加【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "f68e9da93219ec0d493e300c4450e9daebb6ef8638bde5be4b5f8ca177ee433c",
      "translation": "Add an Equip Command to Shops [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "f68e9da93219ec0d493e300c4450e9daebb6ef8638bde5be4b5f8ca177ee433c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ショップに装備コマンドを追加します。",
      "sourceHash": "d4886cada4bdad1972701032375346fe9fe520108b7dba21e75a6f18d23b8846",
      "translation": "Adds an Equip command to shops.",
      "contextHash": "d4886cada4bdad1972701032375346fe9fe520108b7dba21e75a6f18d23b8846"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プレイヤーはショップから出ることなく装備を変更できるようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "b0f0f00b7c9ba5af82f4885ae3744fa08a4d4f982fd1693f67147fcc0540a850",
      "translation": "Players can change equipment without leaving the shop.",
      "contextHash": "b0f0f00b7c9ba5af82f4885ae3744fa08a4d4f982fd1693f67147fcc0540a850"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature on from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
